Strategy Pattern Implementation
Overview

The Strategy Pattern was applied to dynamically choose which graph search algorithm to run.

The API:

Path GraphSearch(String src, String dst, Algorithm algo)

allows users to select:

BFS
DFS
Random Walk

at runtime.

Strategy Classes

The following strategy classes were created:

BFSStrategy
DFSStrategy
RandomWalkStrategy

Each class implements its own search behavior.

Why Strategy Pattern Was Used

The Strategy Pattern was used to separate algorithms into independent interchangeable classes.

Benefits include:

Easy algorithm switching
Better extensibility
Cleaner code structure
Improved maintainability
